Z||000005||c m west||03-09-2001||12:16 AM||||Well spread the word cause I want to get as many Fiero owners here as possible - no date yet - just want to plan it out, it will be a kick back thing on the weekend. Well introduce our products and let folks in on tech secrets for the Fiero....<P>Craig, I have no pics of Fakarhi car, but you can find it on the San Diego club web site<P> I basically want to have this BBQ because everytime we try to plan something for the club ( Fieros West ) there is always too many excuses for people not to come.<P> And there is always questions of how things are run here and Id like everyone to get aqianted with it - the setuop is that Chris West ( my dad ) is the Fiero genius here and Im the guy that is trying to learn half of the stuff that he knows ( hes really sick in the head when it comes to turbochargers, just check out his car on our website ) and trying to keep everything moving here at the shop. I just dont want us to be some anynomous shop out here on the west coast that nodody knows about<P> so whenever anybody is in town or wants to stop by to see whats going on, feel free to....13456 Beach Ave. , Marina Del Rey CA, 90292 - about 10 minutes away from LAX<P>Eric - West Coast Fiero <A HREF="http://www.cwestco.com" TARGET=_blank>www.cwestco.com</A> <BR>310-305-4111||||reg||1
