Z||000009||WKDFIRO||03-10-2001||03:19 AM||||And there is nothing like having a bunch of Fieros around in one place! <P>Al, let me know if you are going and we can caravan over there! That goes for anyone out in this back of the woods!<P>Its about an hour away from us...I went there today to see what was to be seen. Its been a while since Ive been in a Fiero shop since Fiero Motorsports retired and it got me back into the Fiero spirit...even when I got a trafic ticket not more than a mile from there! <P>Seems the police don't appreciate redlining first gear from a stoplight....picky picky...||||reg||6
